{"updated":"2026-11-16T18:44:25.820Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Abdul El-Sayed’s victory is a blow to the politics of Islamophobia. Elsewhere, xi, Trump and Putin to discuss ‘world peace’ at trilateral, says China. And British actor Robert Pattinson named as new James Bond. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 3.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 0.7 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 6.2 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 33 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.4 near 95 km WSW of Changuillo, Peru. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.31,0.37,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.66,0.69,0.73,0.88,1,1.17,1.5,1.63,1.68,1.71,1.74,1.78,1.8,1.82,1.85,1.89,1.94,2.02,2.08,2.13,2.16,2.21,2.25,2.3,2.32,2.38,2.44,2.47,2.51,2.55,2.6,2.66,2.71,2.75,2.82,2.89,2.96,3.08,3.19,3.34,3.37,3.41,3.44,3.5,3.54,3.61,3.73,3.82,3.88,3.95,4,4.06,4.11,4.16,4.2,4.23,4.25,4.3,4.32,4.34,4.37,4.41,4.46,4.55,4.61,4.68,4.76,4.83,4.95,4.98,5.05,5.07,5.13,5.25,5.4,5.57,6.08,6.21,6.28,6.35,6.47,6.51,6.58,6.68,6.73,6.8,6.86,7.01,7.05,7.11,7.16,7.2,7.23,7.28,7.33,7.38,7.44,7.5,7.55,7.62,7.73,7.85,7.96,8,8.05,8.07,8.13,8.17,8.24,8.31,8.35,8.42,8.45,8.47,8.53,8.56,8.58,8.6,8.65,8.7,8.77,8.82,8.89,8.95,9.03,9.1,9.17,9.23,9.28,9.31,9.37,9.41,9.5,9.55,9.65,9.72,9.79,9.86,9.94,10.02,10.09,10.17,10.29,10.49,10.88,10.99,11.05,11.11,11.16,11.2,11.25,11.3,11.34,11.44,11.47,11.64,11.69,11.87,11.95,11.99,12.06,12.13,12.19,12.25,12.31,12.35,12.38,12.41,12.45,12.5,12.55,12.67,12.76,12.83,12.91,13.08,13.15,13.19,13.25,13.29,13.35,13.41,13.48,13.56,13.61,13.68,13.7,13.73,13.77,13.85,13.9,13.97,14.01,14.07,14.14,14.22,14.28,14.